        ("Identify the correct academic sentence structure:", ["Although the study had limitations, the results provided valuable insights.", "Although the study had limitations but the results provided valuable insights.", "Because the study had limitations so the results were bad.", "Despite the study was limited, it was good."], 0, "Subordinating conjunction 'Although' should not be paired with 'but' in the same main clause.", "Do not double-contrast ('Although' + 'but').", 2)
